    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "style": "lede",
      "inlines": [
        "2026 was the year repair became our biggest selling point. Customers bought a Fjordlys lamp because they knew they would never have to throw it away."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "align": "justify",
      "inlines": [
        "Revenue rose 18 per cent to NOK 412 million, and the operating margin widened to 14.2 per cent as the new assembly line in Ålesund reached full speed. Our German shop opened in May and passed its first-year target by October. We took back 11 200 old lamps, repaired three in four of them and recycled the rest down to the screws."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "align": "justify",
      "inlines": [
        "None of this would have happened without the 214 people who work here and the 38 workshops across Europe that service our lamps. Thank you. In 2027 we will open a second repair centre, in Rotterdam, and put a spare-parts catalogue online so that anyone with a screwdriver can fix their own lamp."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
